 ;; statuses above assert. A `:status :open` cannot distinguish "nothing has
 ;; happened" from "most of it works and here is the remainder", and T3 had
 ;; become the second while still reading as the first.
 ;;
 ;; Recorded as measurements with the command that produced them, not as status
 ;; flips: none of the four tranche statuses changed, because none was wrong.
