   :files-naming-chicory 25
   :buckets {:frozen 6 :test-oracle 8 :frozen-repo-other 9 :outside-inventory 2}
   :problems 11
   :note "The sweep used to report every non-frozen hit with one sentence, so a
    historical .clj test and a production provider's import sat in one
    undifferentiated pile of 19 -- while :cutover/rules already separates them
    (:historical-clj-tests :allowed-as-oracle-until-replaced beside
    :new-chicory-call-sites :forbidden). The verifier now classifies, the
